  triage:description "docs/atm-rusqlite/: sql_save-visibility-state.mmd and sql_load-visibility-state.mmd filenames still embed 'visibility-state' after rename. Diagram bodies were updated correctly but the files themselves were not renamed. query-diagrams.md links at lines 20 and 22 reference the old filenames. Fix: rename sql_save-visibility-state.mmd -> sql_save-message-state.mmd and sql_load-visibility-state.mmd -> sql_load-message-state.mmd; update two link references in query-diagrams.md:20,22; regenerate HTML report." ;
